1711-### 30.2 Managed output directory and artifact rules (frozen)
1712-
1713-`output_dir` is an absolute path allocated by the platform, always beneath `OUTPUT_DIR`,
1714:always built with `safe_join` (§9). A provider may write **only** inside `output_dir` or to a
1715-path returned by `stage_artifact()`. Any other write is a contract violation; `artifact_ref`
1716-already refuses to reference one (`ARTIFACT_UNMANAGED`, `adapters/common.py:74-82`).
1717-
1718-| rule | statement |
1719-|---|---|
