1926-```jsonc
1927-{ "unit_index": 3,                 // the scene index from the request; stable, not positional
1928-  "state": "failed",               // succeeded | failed | skipped | cancelled
--
1931-  "error": {"code": "PROVIDER_UNIT_FAILED", "message": "…", "retryable": true} }
